    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The &#8220;Variation Suite for WooCommerce&#8221; plugin powers our enhanced variable product shopping experience, allowing customers to easily customize their purchases using swatches, tables, and grid layouts. With flexible pricing display options and a focus on performanced.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>variation-suite</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>v1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Enhance your product variations with swatches, tables, grid views, and custom price formats. Exclusively designed for variable products.",
